### 1. Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/campus-library/books

###

### 2. Get book details
GET http://localhost:8080/campus-library/books/detail?id=1

###

### 3. Get add book form
GET http://localhost:8080/campus-library/books/add

###

### 4. Add a new book
POST http://localhost:8080/campus-library/books/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Spring in Action&pages=520&authorId=1

###

### 5. Get all authors
GET http://localhost:8080/campus-library/authors
